<title>HONG KONG: BT Fund Managers names business development VP.</title>
<headline>BT Fund Managers names business development VP.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Fund Managers Ltd said on Wednesday it had appointed Grant Forster as vice-president of business development.</p>
<p>BT Fund Managers is the international management subsidiary of the Bankers Trust Group.</p>
<p>Forster will be responsible for marketing to banks and other finanical intermediaries the company's individual fund management services in Asia, BT Fund Managers said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
